を見て、ほのぼのとした。","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第23話\/image74.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","seName":"[SE] 海岸1.mp3","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":-43.43607709750566,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 50","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第23話_d9b92beffa\/元女子校の日常　第23話_d9b92beffa.050.jpeg","seVolume":0.5062235617597292,"duration":7.561519274376417,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/海岸1.mp3","voiceDuration":7.561519274376417,"slideTitle":"第50スライド","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/アリス（困る）.png","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","id":"BD082C58-B969-4C25-BBDE-7CCD6DBD7BAD"},{"telop":"「あの、私の存在を忘れてはいませんか？」","animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第23話\/image74.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"さ&り","transitionName":"なし","seName":"[SE] 海岸1.mp3","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":-50.99759637188208,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_古明地さとり.wav","title":"シーン 51","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第23話_d9b92beffa\/元女子校の日常　第23話_d9b92beffa.051.jpeg","seVolume":0.5062235617597292,"duration":2.3495918367346937,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/海岸1.mp3","voiceDuration":2.3495918367346937,"slideTitle":"第51スラ